    "filters": "Only native public fields; hidden sensitive filters rejected. Supported EQ/NE/IN/LIKE(literal contains)/IS_NULL/NOT_NULL evaluated on authorized projected rows. Numeric EQ/IN ignore decimal scale; GT/GTE/LT/LTE rejected. Empty IN returns no matches."
  },
